"<div class=\"o_assembly_delegation_intro\">\n"
"                <p>Vote delegation form for the assembly <strong t-out=\"object.name\"/>.</p>\n"
"                <p>Identify the delegator and the delegate below and specify the vote types delegated.</p>\n"
"            </div>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<div class=\"o_assembly_delegation_intro\">\n"
"                <p>Formulario de delegación de voto para la asamblea <strong t-out=\"object.name\"/>.</p>\n"
"                <p>Identifique al delegante y al delegado y especifique los tipos de voto delegados.</p>\n"
"            </div>\n"
"        "

